# Secrets outside data/ (data/ is already ignored wholesale). Cookie/token/OAuth
# files must never be committed even if they land elsewhere. bot.log/server.log
# are covered by *.log above.
*cookies*.json
*_token.json
*client_secret*.json
service_account*.json
